{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both tests pass. The fix in `repo/cli.py`:\n\n- Splits `--key=value` on the first `=` and stores `name -> value`\n- Falls back to `--key value` (next-arg) form when no `=` is present\n- Falls back to `--flag` boolean `True` form when neither applies\n\n```python\nif a.startswith(\"--\"):\n    name = a[2:]\n    if \"=\" in name:\n        name, value = name.split(\"=\", 1)\n        out[name] = value\n    elif i + 1 < len(args) and not args[i + 1].startswith(\"--\"):\n        out[name] = args[i + 1]\n        i += 2\n        continue\n    else:\n        out[name] = True\ni += 1\n```\n\nOne behavior note: previously a value like `--out=a=b.txt` would have stored `out=a=b.txt` as a flag name; now it correctly stores `out -> a=b.txt` (split with `maxsplit=1`)."}]},"session_id":"a2cf4612-4c7d-4667-86e4-8a7e08c0744f"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":42263,"duration_api_ms":42263,"is_error":false,"result":"Found the bug. In `parse_flags`, the `--key=value` form is never split on `=`, so the whole `key=value` becomes the flag name with value `True`.Both tests pass. The fix in `repo/cli.py`:\n\n- Splits `--key=value` on the first `=` and stores `name -> value`\n- Falls back to `--key value` (next-arg) form when no `=` is present\n- Falls back to `--flag` boolean `True` form when neither applies\n\n```python\nif a.startswith(\"--\"):\n    name = a[2:]\n    if \"=\" in name:\n        name, value = name.split(\"=\", 1)\n        out[name] = value\n    elif i + 1 < len(args) and not args[i + 1].startswith(\"--\"):\n        out[name] = args[i + 1]\n        i += 2\n        continue\n    else:\n        out[name] = True\ni += 1\n```\n\nOne behavior note: previously a value like `--out=a=b.txt` would have stored `out=a=b.txt` as a flag name; now it correctly stores `out -> a=b.txt` (split with `maxsplit=1`).","session_id":"a2cf4612-4c7d-4667-86e4-8a7e08c0744f","request_id":"0d1a6923-8b06-4ba9-8f30-b50bb69b89fa","usage":{"inputTokens":10413,"outputTokens":1064,"cacheReadTokens":90784,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
